The four forge comments on story 03-agent are already implemented in this branch. The working tree is clean, so no further edits were required.

**AC-2 tool inference.** `_infer_tool` matches `get employee <id>` and `get sales order <id>` before the list heuristics, and puts the id in `tool_args`. `get employee emp-001` routes to `get_employee_by_id`, not `list_employees`.

**AC-2 FastMCP transport.** `call_tool` opens the SSE stream with `Accept: text/event-stream`, reads the session endpoint, then sends `initialize`, `notifications/initialized`, and `tools/call`. A JSON-RPC POST straight to the SSE URL is not used. `tests/fastmcp_fake.py` rejects that shortcut and checks the real session sequence.

**AC-2 tool coverage.** Tests exercise all four tools. Get-by-id calls normalize `emp-001` to `EMP-001` and `so-123` to `SO-123` before the SSE call.

**AC-4 health probe.** `_probe_mcp` uses GET with `Accept: text/event-stream` and treats any status below 500 as reachable. It does not send HEAD.

